      <main>
        <h2>Help Centre</h2>
        <p>
          We're here to make your shopping experience as easy as possible. Browse the answers to some of our most common
          questions below.
        </p>

        <p>
          📦 How do I track my order?

          Once your order has been shipped, you'll receive a confirmation email containing your tracking number and a
          link to the courier's website. You can also track your order by signing in to your account and visiting the My
          Orders section.
        </p>

        <p>
          ↩️ Can I return a book?

          Yes. You can return most books within 30 days of delivery, provided they are in their original condition. If
          your order arrives damaged or incorrect, please contact our customer support team, and we'll be happy to
          assist you.
        </p>

        <p>
          ❌ Can I cancel an order?

          Orders can be cancelled before they have been dispatched. If your order has already been shipped, you'll need
          to wait until it arrives and then request a return according to our Returns Policy.
        </p>

        <p>
          💳 What payment methods do you accept?

          We accept all major credit and debit cards, including Visa, Mastercard, and Maestro. Secure online payments
          ensure that your personal information is protected throughout the checkout process.
        </p>

        <p>
          🚚 How long does delivery take?

          Delivery times vary depending on your location.

          Standard Delivery: 3–7 business days
          Express Delivery: 1–3 business days

          Estimated delivery times are displayed during checkout.
        </p>

        <p>
          🌍 Do you offer international shipping?

          Yes! We deliver to many countries worldwide. Shipping costs and delivery times are calculated automatically
          during checkout based on your destination.
        </p>

        <p>
          🔒 Is my payment information secure?

          Absolutely. We use secure encryption technology to protect your payment details. Your financial information is
          processed safely and is never stored on our servers.
        </p>

        <p>
          👤 Do I need an account to place an order?

          No. You can check out as a guest. However, creating an account allows you to save your favourite books, track
          your orders, and enjoy a faster checkout experience.
        </p>

        <p>
          📚 What if the book I want is out of stock?

          If a book is temporarily unavailable, you can add it to your Wishlist or check back later. Popular titles are
          restocked regularly.
          Still Need Help?
        </p>

        <p>
          If you can't find the answer you're looking for, don't hesitate to <a href="/contacts">contact us</a>. We're always happy to help and
          will do our best to respond as quickly as possible.
        </p>

      </main>
      </div>

